    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42436" root="يبس" body-key="Y">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يابسهُ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He treated him with dryness and
hardness,</i> or <i>niggardliness;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَاسَحَهُ</span>; (L, K,
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قسح</span>;) i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عامله باليبس والشدّه</span>. (TK, in
that art.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَابِسٌ</span>.]

